desc
@sbk - sort by key (more-or-less, I think)
Changes a list of filenames of backups into glob patterns by host/container.

Intended to make it easy to produce grouped list of filenames to
select and edit to delete some of the files.

The name sbk was probably actually semi-random typing.
"Sort By" probably accurate.  K more random?
